OL,3,GNEWSAChin-up champion secures Guinness
OL,4,AWorld Record title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former professional mixed martial
OL,7,Fartist from County Down has broken the
OL,8,FGuinness World Record for most chin-ups
OL,9,Fin an hour whilst wearing a 20lb
OL,10,Fweight.
OL,12,FDamien Rooney from Burren, outside
OL,13,FNewry, clocked up 499 reps to beat the
OL,14,Fprevious record of 495.
OL,16,FHe now intends to build upon the record
OL,17,Fand push towards a fresh challenge for
OL,18,Fthe 24-hour record which could require
OL,19,Fas many as 10,000 reps.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
